{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大号白紫标题，紫色强调词“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”和“连那些气也肯再受”最吸引视线；随后容易被下方同样醒目的大号紫色句子吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他似乎想回去，却说不清自己为什么想回去；具体处境还没有完全抓住。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定。能扫到“怕孤单”和“心慌”，但无法立即判断哪一种是此刻的核心感受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他究竟是眷恋曾经被当作自己人的日子，还是害怕孤独到愿意再次忍受委屈；以及这个矛盾的念头让他心慌，甚至不敢继续想。中间段还补充了他已经知道过去的自己经历过什么，但问题依然没有简单答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题虽然字号大，但两行长句包含两种不同动机和复杂的转折关系，紫色强调词单独看不足以直接说明完整意思。\",\n    \"下方另一句字号接近、同样醒目，形成第二个视觉焦点；核心处境与心慌的反应分散在两块文字里，需要联系起来理解。\",\n    \"中间四行小字连续铺陈，包含额外的心理变化信息，但不是扫一眼就能直接拿到的内容。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "48a20b17-2de4-43fe-bbbc-e711a610062e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012613101584Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.296, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:27:03.396433+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0c316b5a56a21e5a90ecfd87c4212c7e7ad0c3f8b446b30ffe04c94961b0753", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012613101584Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2a32dea29e0e402860882390ac2ade9ba106aefcba9963a86d8be3c5281664f7"}}}
